# Copy to .env and fill in what you use. Loaded automatically by the islandgame package; never committed.
# Nothing here is required to play the game by hand, run the tests, or drive it from Claude Code over MCP.

# ---- Play with your own AI (browser "AI plays" button and `island-play`) ----
# Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Examples:
#   Ollama:   ISLAND_MODEL=qwen3:14b            ISLAND_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
#   OpenAI:   ISLAND_MODEL=gpt-5-mini           ISLAND_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1   ISLAND_API_KEY=sk-...
#   vLLM:     ISLAND_MODEL=<served-model-name>  ISLAND_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/v1
ISLAND_MODEL=
ISLAND_BASE_URL=
ISLAND_API_KEY=
# ISLAND_MODEL_LABEL=My model      # dropdown label, defaults to ISLAND_MODEL

# ---- Optional: W&B (Weave traces, W&B Inference, Serverless Training) ----
# Your entity (team or username) and project. With this set, every game is traced in Weave and
# gpt-oss-20b on W&B Inference appears as a baseline player. Log in with `wandb login` or set WANDB_API_KEY.
# WANDB_PROJECT=<your-entity>/island-hopper
# WANDB_API_KEY=

# ---- Optional: a model you trained with train/train_rl.py ----
# Registered as <WANDB_PROJECT>/<model_name>; STEP is the checkpoint to load as the "after RL" player.
# ISLAND_CHECKPOINT=wandb-artifact:///<your-entity>/island-hopper/island-hopper-qwen14b
# ISLAND_CHECKPOINT_STEP=0
